      "about": {
        "title": "Built like a house, heats like a sauna",
        "lede": "A sauna and a covered shower porch in one unit, about 12' × 7' overall.",
        "items": [
          [
            "R24 insulated walls",
            "4½\" structural insulated panels with a foil barrier and an air gap behind the cedar keep the heat in, so it warms up faster and holds temperature in January."
          ],
          [
            "A shower porch at the door",
            "A 42\" wide cedar-lined porch sits at one end with the sauna’s glass door opening into it, so the cold rinse is one step from the bench."
          ],
          [
            "Choose your feature wall",
            "Keep the classic all-cedar look, or add a rhombus or hexagon cedar feature wall for a bolder interior."
          ],
          [
            "Metal siding, three colours",
            "Powder-coated metal in black, white or woodgrain, with black aluminum accents. Low-maintenance, and it never needs staining."
          ]
        ]
